STACK
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
- Flutter (latest stable)
- State management: flutter_bloc (BLoC for complex, Cubit for simple)
- Backend: Supabase (auth, database, realtime, storage)
- Dependency injection: GetIt + injectable
- Navigation: GoRouter
- Error handling: dartz (Either<Failure, Success>)
- Architecture: Clean Architecture (data / domain / presentation)
- Equatable for BLoC state comparison
- cached_network_image for images
- connectivity_plus for network checks

